Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:44:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Combat HUD, cast auras, self-silence skill bar, boat walking
 fix

- Status window: 13 STATUSEXTRA values incl. buffed PvP/PvM stats and min/max damage, 500 ms refresh
- Skill bar: separate own self-silence from enemy silence; Cleanse allowed under enemy CC
- Cast auras for cast-time abilities, also drawn for other players' casts
- Boat: shift the local player by the boat delta instead of snapping to the server position
- HUD rescale, top bar centered, debug stats font, AltGr lock, gather corpses, ScrollSay packet
- Updated ExternalImages

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
